        <li><strong>GMT 23:00:</strong> Results in WAT 00:00 (midnight) at the start of the <strong>NEXT calendar date</strong>.</li>
        <li><strong>GMT 23:30:</strong> Results in WAT 00:30 AM on the <strong>NEXT calendar date</strong>.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        For instance, a system deployment scheduled for 23:30 GMT on Thursday, December 31 takes place at 00:30 AM WAT on Friday, January 1 in Lagos.
      </p>
